Method to Execute [user-defined ribbon tab]
Type in the name of the Method, which the Text to Display calls and executes, into the respective cell.
Remarks
When Methods are called by the user-defined ribbon tab, the anonymous identifier ? (question mark)
points to the Frame in which the selection was executed. Use this to selectively access objects in the
respective Frame.
Parameter
If the method to execute expects a parameter, Plant Simulation automatically passes it. The objects, which
you selected in the Frame, are passed to this parameter, which has to be of data type list or an array of
data type object.
Example
?.MyStation.proctime := str_to_time(prompt)
