Paste Row [user-defined ribbon tab]
Pastes the data of the row from the clipboard to the table in the dialog. While doing this Plant Simulation
looks for line breaks and tabulators, separates the text accordingly, and pastes the text into the table.
Remarks
To control where Plant Simulation pastes the row:
• Click in the row where you want to paste the row from the clipboard and select Paste Row to replace
the current row and overwrite its contents. You can also paste the row from the clipboard at the end of
the table without overwriting any content.
• Hold down Ctrl and select Paste Row to paste the row from the clipboard above the current row in the
table. This does not overwrite existing data.
• Hold down Ctrl and Shift and select Paste Row to paste the row from the clipboard below the current
row in the table. This does not overwrite existing data.
