Note
The commands on the user-defined context menu only apply to the selected object(s) within the Frame
for which you defined the context menu.
The Class Library does not show the user-defined context menu.
Let us demonstrate this with an example: We created a context menu in the Frame named
MyComponent1. When we insert MyComponent1 into our model MyPlantAnytown and click the icon
of the inserted MyComponent1 with the right mouse button, Plant Simulation shows the context menu
we created.
Configure User-defined Context Menu
