Reorder Successors
To reorder the sequence of the successors of the selected object, select this command. This way you can
change the order of the Connectors without having to delete these and reconnect the objects.
Remarks
The sequence of the successors affects how the parts are transported through your simulation model.
Plant Simulation establishes the sequence of the Connector when you connect the objects which you
inserted into a Frame.
To move the selected object up in the sequence of the successors, click Up.
To move the selected object down in the sequence of the successors, click Down.
To delete the Connector from the selected object to its successor, click Delete or press the Delete key. This
is helpful if you cannot see the Connectors because the objects are placed so close that they touch each
other.
